   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stem_html": "<p>Which statement best describes the following tables?</p>\n <br> <table class=\"unnumbered\">\n    <caption>Table A</caption>\n    <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\"><span data-math=\"x\">x</span></th>\n      <th scope=\"col\"><span data-math=\"y\">y</span></th>\n    </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1 </td>\n      <td>3 </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>2 </td>\n      <td>6 </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>3 </td>\n      <td>9 </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>4 </td>\n      <td>12 </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>5 </td>\n      <td>15 </td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n    <caption>Table B</caption>\n    <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\"><span data-math=\"x\">x</span></th>\n      <th scope=\"col\"><span data-math=\"y\">y</span></th>\n    </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1 </td>\n      <td>3 </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>2 </td>\n      <td>6 </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>3 </td>\n      <td>12 </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>4 </td>\n      <td>24 </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>5 </td>\n      <td>48 </td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1136536,
     "content_html": "Table A represents an exponential function with a constant difference of 3; Table B represents a linear function with a constant growth factor of 2."
    },
    {
